OL,3,GNEWSAParents told 'more than once'
OL,4,Aabout unsafe parking
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice say parents parked unsafely and
OL,7,Finconsiderately near schools had to be
OL,8,F"spoken to on more than one occasion"
OL,9,Fon the same day.
OL,11,FIn a joint operation with the fire
OL,12,Fservice, the Northamptonshire force
OL,13,Fchallenged 14 drivers who had stopped
OL,14,Fon corners, double yellow lines, on or
OL,15,Fby a pedestrian crossing, or had double
OL,16,Fparked and were blocking access for
OL,17,Femergency vehicles.
OL,19,FIt said the aim of the parking
OL,20,Fclampdown in Northampton had been to
OL,21,Fhighlight what police officers and fire
OL,22,Fcrews "encounter daily".
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
