OL,3,GNEWSAParents told 'more than once'
OL,4,Aabout unsafe parking
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Even small delays can have serious
OL,7,Fconsequences when emergency services
OL,8,Fare responding to incidents where
OL,9,Flives, property or public safety are at
OL,10,Frisk," a police statement added.
